---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SplitBioLayout from '../../components/SplitBioLayout.astro';
import actingHero from '../../assets/hero/IMG_1570.JPG';
---

<BaseLayout title="Acting" description="Reischa's acting bio, reel, resume, and casting profile links.">
	<SplitBioLayout
		image={actingHero}
		imageAlt="Reischa Harrell, a Nashville actress"
		title="Acting"
		mediaFraction={0.3}
	>
		<p class="lede">
			Reischa is an actress from Nashville, Tennessee. She loved attending
			theater and film events as early as she can remember. In high school,
			her English and Drama teacher gave her several onstage opportunities
			in school plays and competitions. While in college, she earned
			another first role as Dunyasha in Anton Chekov's "The Cherry Orchard"
			with Murfreesboro Ensemble Theatre. Through these experiences, she
			caught the bug for acting and performing.
		</p>
		<p>
			She earned a Bachelor of Art in Theatre Performance with a voice
			minor from Middle Tennessee State University. A few favorite roles
			include Fastrada in "Pippin" (Boiler Room Theatre), Margaret in "The
			Selkie" (MTSU), and Lady Capulet in "Romeo and Juliet" (Theatre
			Ensemble of Nashville). Other credits include Maggie in "Lend Me a
			Tenor", and Suzanne in the "Murder Room" both at Encore Theatre. She
			has actively continued studying acting at Lee Strassberg Institute,
			Actor's Bridge and Nashville Acting School. She is also in demand as
			a dance performer and teacher.
		</p>
		<ul class="sub-links">
			<li><a href="/acting/resume">Resume</a></li>
			<li><a href="/acting/headshots">Headshots</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/15zt35nlf3hiao68fw3lw/2026FINALREEL.mp4?rlkey=7dxnze256mi9wjr25qonndjpb&st=har5cxaq&dl=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reel</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm7614212/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IMDB</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL4FvKvQICdbYmmpzDSqlqjeX-qkh8caIM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube Page</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://actorsaccess.com/actor/preview/actor_details.cfm?tab=profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Actor's Access</a></li>
		</ul>
	</SplitBioLayout>
</BaseLayout>
